Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:36.60,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(481,478)\fs13\shad2\c&H222C04&\3c&HEEDCCF&\blur0\bord1\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\4c&HC7CD96&\pos(125,65)}Episode {\c&H8065C7&}3       {\c&H8F8B3E&\3c&HEDD7D3&}Closed {\c&H222C04&}All Day Today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:43.56,Default,Employee,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:48.46,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Let's try not to fail any subjects \Nwith the festival coming up, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.78,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.78,0:01:52.63,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,You bet. Later, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:06.90,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,It looks dark inside too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.90,0:02:08.67,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,I wonder what could have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.30,0:02:10.28,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.74,0:02:12.15,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,How's it goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:14.57,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,Oh, Kyu-chan. You're back early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:17.06,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Well, it's finals week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.71,0:02:20.54,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Is there some reason \Nwhy you're all standing around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:24.92,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,Actually, you've got perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:27.92,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,You see, it's a regular business day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:31.67,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,but Kinme-san hasn't opened her shop yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:34.43,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\shad0\c&H544D49&\3c&HAEBCC2&\fs30\t(\fs26)\pos(327,103)}We are closed for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:37.05,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,So we were all wondering about \Nwhat could have happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:37.93,Default - Top,Regular 2,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:37.93,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:39.66,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.63,0:02:43.81,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,Yes. So we'd like your help, Kyu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:08.21,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,Well? Can you see inside the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:10.63,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:18.16,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Is this... okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:23.61,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Oh, it's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:29.98,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:44.16,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Kinme-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.27,0:03:51.52,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:59.46,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Uh... are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:11.04,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:12.65,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,Oh dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:14.35,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Well, she sounds all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:18.78,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:22.53,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,She was only sleeping.\N Nothin' to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:25.78,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,I'm glad it turned out to be nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:28.16,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,I suppose she just overslept after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:32.17,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh no! You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:38.80,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,U-Uh, I'm very sorry for \Ncoming in without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:48.06,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that stuff \Nfrom last night did me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:50.40,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh? Stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:57.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yesterday, I picked up \Na number of items from a customer,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:05:01.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and among them was one \Nvery unique and delicate piece
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.59,0:05:04.35,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,that required extra time and care to wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:12.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I was so proud of myself \Nafter accomplishing such a big job,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:14.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I must have let it go to my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:21.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Then, one of my regulars showed up before \Nclosing time and invited me out to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:25.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And I just... jumped at the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:30.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(336,20)\shad0\fnVerdana\c&H5F5E69&\3c&HBBE2DC&}Welcome\NRestaurant with an Ocean View
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:29.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I was so excited to try out \Na new restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:38.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I even ordered a drink,\N which I almost never do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.65,0:05:46.35,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,With the first drink—\Nno, with the first sip,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:50.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,my mind went completely blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:56.32,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,{\t(4070,4904,\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}I had no idea I was actually \Nsuch a lightweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:02.67,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(398,1)\3c&H5E58B1&\1c&H59D6E2&\shad0\b1}Turmeric\NExtract
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:02.25,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Turmeric pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:06.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,When and how did I even make it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.79,0:06:09.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Did I make my customer carry me home?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:11.87,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:14.63,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,So I guess you really like \Nto let loose sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.63,0:06:15.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,N-No, I do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.39,0:06:20.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I absolutely do not l-let loose at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:23.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.37,0:06:28.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, what time is it right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:30.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I-It is still morning, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:32.58,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh... It's around noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.15,0:06:37.84,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Is she all right, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:51.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm going downstairs\N to tend to the customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:55.74,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,K-Kyusho-kun, \Njust make yourself at home up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:07:00.11,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah. Make myself at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:02.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:06.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:11.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for waking me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:13.63,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah. No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:16.98,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,She's not mad that I snuck in like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:22.13,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And I need to ask you for one favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:28.76,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Will you promise not to tell anyone that \NI fell asleep in such a slovenly manner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:30.76,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Uh... oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:35.52,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,It's not really something \NI'd go around telling people anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.63,0:07:45.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,P-Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.07,0:07:54.98,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Um, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:08:00.29,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I haven't made a pinkie promise since...\N what, kindergarten maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:01.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.26\b1\frx0\fry10\fs30\c&H226D73&\3c&H632D6E&\shad0\pos(413.6,187)\frz24.77}Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:01.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.26\b1\frx0\fry10\fs25\c&H8A6B13&\3c&H938872&\shad0\frz20.36\pos(420.6,269)}2x Points
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:01.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.26\b1\frx0\fry10\fs25\c&H8A6B13&\3c&H938872&\shad0\frz18.83\pos(427.6,329)}Every Tuesday
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:02.04,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.26\b1\frx0\fry10\fs30\c&H82E5FC&\3c&HBA86E9&\shad0\pos(413.6,187)\frz24.77}Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:02.04,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.26\b1\frx0\fry10\fs25\c&HEEC860&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\frz20.36\pos(420.6,269)}2x Points
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:02.04,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.26\b1\frx0\fry10\fs25\c&HEEC860&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\frz18.83\pos(427.6,329)}Every Tuesday
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:04.92,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&H612E2A&\3c&HAAAFAD&\b1\fs16}I washed it, but it still isn't clean!\N\N{\3c&H48407D&\c&HAFAEBB&}Well...\N  {\c&H000000&\3c&HBDBFBD&}that's because of a {\c&HB2B9B5&\3c&H34267B&}mismatch\Nbetween the {\c&H872423&\3c&HBDBFBD&}kind of stain\Nand your type of cleaning!\N\N{\c&H696566&\3c&HD4D4D4&}At Kinme Cleaning, we use\Nwashing methods tailored\Nto the exact type of\Ncleaning you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:06.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I sincerely apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:08.06,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,It's fine, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:10.93,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,We know you have a lot \Non your hands, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:22.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:25.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:29.23,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I apologize that I was unable \Nto answer the phone this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:31.45,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, a pick-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:31.45,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,C'mere, c'mere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:32.88,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:34.96,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,Good job, Kyu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.34,0:08:35.57,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.57,0:08:38.53,Default,Regular 1,0,0,0,,Here's a little reward for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:36.75,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:39.96,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:41.93,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,In that case, we should move quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:44.28,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:46.46,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Haven't had these\N since kindergarten, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:46.46,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes. I could be there...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:49.35,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes. Five o'clock is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:52.48,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, perfectly all right. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:53.21,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,I probably shouldn't distract her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:55.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course! Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:57.89,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You can count on Kinme.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:09:01.67,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,So, have you tried\N that new restaurant yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:02.73,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Holy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.18,0:09:05.38,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I figured I should check in on her,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:08.49,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,but what's with the crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:10.46,Default - Top,Regular,0,0,0,,So quickly, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:11.74,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Young man there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:12.49,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Uh, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:15.09,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,You just came out of the cleaners, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:18.00,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Would you happen to know\N something about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:19.93,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,No, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:23.75,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,It seems like Kinme-san\N overslept for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:26.49,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh, you don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.15,0:09:31.27,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I did give her some turmeric pills \Nwhen we went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.27,0:09:32.76,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I hope she remembered to take some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:36.64,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\c&H7E81B4&\3c&HD8DFE2&\fad(482,1)}For Liver Health! \N{\3c&H5E58B1&\1c&H59D6E2&\shad0\b1}Turmeric Extract {\fs18\c&H5B6478&\3c&H56BFCE&}Tablets
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:36.23,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Turmeric?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:38.48,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:43.58,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I invited Kinme-san out\N to dinner last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:46.15,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Is this the regular she was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:51.28,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,And get this, Kinme-san said \Nshe'd never had alcohol before,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:53.72,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,but she didn't get drunk at all
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:56.78,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,and was walking perfectly fine\N on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.21,0:10:01.37,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,So I'm betting she didn't oversleep \Nbecause I got her drunk or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:06.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I really apologize for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:08.30,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:12.50,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,By the way, young man, \Nare you one of her customers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:14.08,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,You look more like a student to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:17.30,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I just happened to be passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:21.10,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I noticed the shop was still closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:24.31,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,so I went in through the second floor \Nand woke her up. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:27.48,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,The second floor, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:35.74,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I have to rush back to work right now, \Nbut tell Kinme-san I said hi, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:38.16,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:43.10,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:46.67,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,You'd better be careful \Nnot to fall for her or anything, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:48.42,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:56.20,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,What does someone like that\N do for a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.18,0:11:04.18,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\an8\fnArial\c&H1A1B1B&\3c&H899EA5&}Guesthouse Inn Ishimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:06.69,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Here ya go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.11,0:11:11.56,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,I thought the customers had more kids \Nthan they did and made one too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:12.94,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Now clean your plate, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:17.87,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Another first since kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:23.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(419,24)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
