Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:01.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good morning, Poly-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:08.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:22.26,sign_17755_172_Marion_Cleaner,text,0,0,0,,Marion\NCleaner
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:46.06,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:55.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.73,0:13:10.06,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,For the shop, I like to make \Nnew posters and flyers every season.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:16.97,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,I get more active with sales campaigns \Nwhen there's a dip in customer traffic.
