Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.71,0:13:42.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(400,1)\c&H1A1B1B&\shad0\fs10\pos(567,95)\bord0}* Please present this flyer
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.84,0:13:42.09,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(400,1)\c&H1A1B1B&\shad0\fs16\bord0\an7\pos(406,105)}Dry cleaning does not\N eliminate sweat stains and smells!\N In order to get sweat particles\Nout of clothes completely,\N {\fs19\c&HE6EAB7&\3c&HCBA783&\bord2}wet {\fs16\c&H1A1B1B&\bord0}(water) cleaning is best!\N Please give our\Nwet cleaning service a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:21.05,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,I distribute my flyers by hand to people \Nwho live in the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:31.04,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,Personally, I prefer to meet people \Nat their front door as much as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:28.40,Default - Top,Customer,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:31.19,Default - Top,Customer,0,0,0,,Oh! Hello, Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.19,0:14:32.31,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.33,0:14:34.44,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,so I can hand them a flyer in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:38.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm having a sale right now, \Nso please take advantage of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:39.27,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:41.64,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Thank you for dropping this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:43.78,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll have something for you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.78,0:14:46.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Great! Just give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:55.19,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Oh, Kinme-san! Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:56.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.07,0:14:58.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.01,0:15:01.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm holding a sale right now. \NWould you like a coupon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.47,0:15:06.55,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you. \NI'll definitely be using you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:18.81,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\c&HA4E5E1&\3c&H9A501C&\shad0\fax0.26\fs30\pos(113,157)\frz353.6}Gift Shop\N{\an7\b1\c&HA4E5E1&\3c&H9A501C&\shad0\fax0.26\b1\c&HA4E5E1&\3c&H9A501C&\fs24\shad0\pos(116,190)\frz353.6}\hAtsuei Dried Fish Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:25.32,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.\N Delivery from Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:27.82,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:32.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I've brought the item \Nyou left with me the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:34.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Also this, if you're interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:36.96,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:48.90,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:52.82,Default,Employee,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the big catch banner \Nshe took away to wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:57.35,Default,Employee,0,0,0,,Now that it's all cleaned up, \Nwhy don't we hang it up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:16:00.38,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Yes, I suppose we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:05.49,Default,Employee,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.82,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.87,0:16:12.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It is wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:15.14,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:17.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I know how valuable it is to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:21.73,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,You might be getting another \Nphone call from Nairo sometime,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:24.00,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,but I hope you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.55,0:16:27.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,All right! You can count on Kinme.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:38.23,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,It feels nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:02.97,Default,Tourist,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:06.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh! I just needed a way \Nto get out of the rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:07.30,Default,Tourist,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.30,0:17:10.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:15.54,Default,Tourist,0,0,0,,I haven't visited in a while, \Nbut it sure is a lot fancier than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:18.06,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, that's what I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:23.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I don't know how the station used to be,\Nbut sometimes I start to wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:26.09,Default,Tourist,0,0,0,,I've got an old picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:28.94,Default,Tourist,0,0,0,,See? There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:33.91,Default,Tourist,0,0,0,,We visited once before \Nwhen my daughter was still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.91,0:17:35.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:39.45,Default,Daughter,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I remember\N something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:42.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What a lovely memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:44.80,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,The festival is only one week away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.80,0:18:47.02,Default,Adult,0,0,0,,Try to match everyone else's rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:49.92,Default - Top,Adult,0,0,0,,Tam, tam! Tam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.09,0:18:50.78,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,They sure are practicing hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:53.14,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:55.54,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,That reminds me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:09.24,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,When I can hear that sound \Ncoming from around the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:13.40,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,it really starts to sink in \Nthat it's summertime again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.37,0:19:18.84,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I wonder how many times \NI've climbed up on the roof like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:23.77,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I think I came up twice\N to watch fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.81,0:19:26.36,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.42,0:20:00.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot! I haven't finished \Nmaking the poster yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.65,0:20:04.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Off I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:33.96,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\move(317,348,317,162)\bord1\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\c&H6B797B&\3c&H15151D&}Offering
