Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:43.97,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\shad0\c&H86452D&\3c&HA39993&\fs11\t(1,4481 \fs8)\move(358,176,354,180,18,4481)}You'll also receive \Na special extra something\Nfor the season.
