Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:20.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\shad0\c&H544D49&\3c&H8F8D85&\fs30\pos(312,180)}On a break
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.35,0:22:23.86,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Well, that explains it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.23,0:22:29.58,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,So I wanted to ask, how do you \Nspend your days off, Kinme-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:31.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:37.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I clean the shop, pass out sale flyers, \Nand make posters and things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.10,0:22:41.29,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,But that's just another workday!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.03,0:22:44.47,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm. You might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.81,0:22:48.37,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! Next time, \Nyou want to try some volleyball?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.37,0:22:50.22,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Volleyball?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.65,0:22:55.48,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Yeah! I play ladies' volleyball. \NI thought you might wanna give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.86,0:22:58.68,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I have a feeling \Nyou've got a talent for sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.68,0:23:01.23,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I bet you'd catch on quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.23,0:23:05.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I wonder, though. \NDo you really think I'd be any good?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.25,0:23:06.86,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, you'd be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.27,0:23:12.87,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,And after volleyball, the members all \Ngo out together to relax at a hot spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.15,0:23:17.29,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,There's nothing better than \Na hot spring after some exercise!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.57,0:23:21.55,Italics,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hot spring? That does sound nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.46,0:23:26.80,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Looks like you'd be more interested \Nin the hot spring part.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.69,0:23:29.40,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,But just think about it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.63,0:23:31.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:39.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\c&H020201&\bord0\pos(335,154)}Episode {\c&H8A80CC&}4 {\c&H020201}A Personal Request from {\c&HA49F43&}Kinme
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:38.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Next time is\N "A personal request from Kinme."
